WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.200
FLASHBACK

00:09.320 --> 00:10.650
Saitou speaking.

00:10.650 --> 00:12.530
<i>The new semester starts tomorrow.</i>

00:12.530 --> 00:15.120
<i>When I heard the news of my brother's death,</i>

00:15.120 --> 00:20.890
<i>I decided that I should use the remainder of the holiday to redeem myself.</i>

00:20.890 --> 00:24.060
<i>I need to make up for the wrong I committed against her.</i>

00:24.060 --> 00:29.740
<i>If only this nightmare were my only punishment.</i>

00:29.740 --> 00:35.000
<i>That was just my stupid, selfish fantasy.</i>

00:35.010 --> 00:44.220
Kuttskukiboshi

00:35.010 --> 00:38.950
- Stars Intertwined -

00:38.950 --> 00:44.220
Part Two

00:45.170 --> 00:51.560
The strong, large-scale hurricane 11 appears to be approaching the Kanto coast.

00:51.560 --> 00:54.360
Expect a large storm on the last weekend of summer vacation.

00:57.290 --> 00:59.240
<i>She hasn't come...</i>

01:08.120 --> 01:09.650
She brought it...

01:29.150 --> 01:31.030
What's this?

01:39.910 --> 01:42.680
Location of your phone: PE shed

01:48.920 --> 01:53.050
My phone's in the PE shed?

01:57.290 --> 01:59.470
Where is it?

02:43.140 --> 02:45.640
Huh? What happened?

02:45.640 --> 02:48.180
Oh, no! Hey...

02:53.250 --> 02:55.590
What?! What's going—

03:05.650 --> 03:10.200
Why? What do you want...?

03:10.200 --> 03:12.120
Stop...

03:12.120 --> 03:15.100
Stop it!

04:18.750 --> 04:20.190
Water.

04:35.930 --> 04:37.720
You're not eating?

04:48.830 --> 04:49.770
I'll have some.

05:24.620 --> 05:29.810
Umm... I think my hands are swollen.

05:37.010 --> 05:39.400
<i>It's done!</i>

05:39.400 --> 05:42.680
<i>It should still work, even though I altered the shape.</i>

05:42.680 --> 05:45.070
<i>This looks better.</i>

05:45.070 --> 05:49.480
<i>This will make Kiichan want to carry it with her everyday.</i>

05:49.480 --> 05:51.940
<i>Maybe...</i>

05:51.940 --> 05:53.780
<i>Is this weird?</i>

05:55.110 --> 05:59.820
<i>Anyway, I won't tell her where I got it.</i>

06:28.680 --> 06:30.280
That was...

06:40.700 --> 06:44.110
Yeah, I've been at a friend's house.

06:44.110 --> 06:46.430
Yeah.

06:46.430 --> 06:49.200
She invited me to come study with her.

06:50.090 --> 06:52.920
Oh...

06:52.920 --> 06:54.490
I know.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.600
My parents are pissed.

07:00.640 --> 07:02.620
It's been several days.

07:04.870 --> 07:06.480
Can you open that for me?

07:08.010 --> 07:09.890
Oh, right.

07:27.990 --> 07:29.870
What's wrong?

07:29.870 --> 07:33.600
I forgot the combination.

07:36.290 --> 07:37.690
Hey...

07:37.690 --> 07:40.460
I wanted to ask you...

07:40.460 --> 07:43.610
What were you doing with your brother that time?

07:44.690 --> 07:47.420
You still haven't told me anything.

07:47.420 --> 07:49.480
What? Nothing much.

07:49.480 --> 07:52.400
Do you hate me now?

07:52.400 --> 07:53.550
Just because of that?

07:53.550 --> 07:55.890
"Just that"?!

07:59.470 --> 08:00.730
Hey.

08:13.610 --> 08:15.210
It's hot...

08:15.210 --> 08:20.540
I saw before that the door to the pool changing rooms wasn't locked.

08:20.540 --> 08:23.130
When you're done, you don't need to close the door.

08:23.130 --> 08:26.650
By the way, don't get me wrong.

08:26.650 --> 08:31.220
I was only with you because you found out about my powers.

08:31.220 --> 08:33.320
But I'm through with all this.

08:35.430 --> 08:36.310
Bye.

08:44.990 --> 08:49.460
<i>What have I been wanting to do this whole week?</i>

08:49.460 --> 08:53.180
<i>I'm just a guinea pig in an experiment.</i>

08:53.180 --> 08:58.150
<i>But... if I wanted to, I could always escape.</i>

08:58.150 --> 09:06.710
<i>Oh, well... I'm just really angry right now.</i>

09:16.350 --> 09:18.500
Incoming call: City General Hospital

09:34.350 --> 09:35.660
You're so tan!

09:35.660 --> 09:36.890
I went to the beach four times!

09:36.890 --> 09:38.320
That's too much!

09:38.320 --> 09:40.020
Oh, crap! The teacher's here!

09:41.190 --> 09:44.360
All right, get to your seats! Homeroom is starting.

09:45.460 --> 09:47.370
Kawakami!

09:47.370 --> 09:50.510
I marked you as absent since you weren't at the opening ceremony.

09:50.510 --> 09:52.320
But I'll just mark you as late now.

09:52.320 --> 09:54.200
So come on in.

09:55.840 --> 09:57.380
Wonder if it's 'cause of Saitou.

09:57.380 --> 10:02.100
It's the first day of a new semester, and Kawakami's late, and Saitou's absent.

10:02.100 --> 10:04.440
Let's start homeroom then!

10:05.680 --> 10:09.890
<i>Aaya didn't come to school.</i>

10:09.890 --> 10:12.570
<i>I wanted to ask how she felt,</i>

10:12.570 --> 10:15.390
<i>but I couldn't bring myself to text or call her.</i>

10:16.120 --> 10:19.370
<i>Maybe it's 'cause I'm scared that she wouldn't reply.</i>

10:19.370 --> 10:21.210
<i>I want to forget everything,</i>

10:21.210 --> 10:25.550
<i>and believe that maybe Saitou Aaya never existed in the first place.</i>

10:25.550 --> 10:29.270
<i>But... I can't think that way.</i>

10:29.270 --> 10:32.580
<i>My thoughts are only of her.</i>

10:33.160 --> 10:36.060
And with that, I'll be collecting the summer break assignments now.

10:36.060 --> 10:38.880
Bring them in order of roll call.

10:38.880 --> 10:41.660
— <i>Assignment?</i>
— Oh, no!

10:41.660 --> 10:42.690
<i>I totally forgot...</i>

10:44.050 --> 10:45.420
<i>No...</i>

10:58.120 --> 10:59.300
Thank you.

10:59.300 --> 11:01.780
Get home safely.

12:02.320 --> 12:05.270
Let's do it again, for the last time.

12:07.510 --> 12:09.210
Wait! My bag!

12:27.430 --> 12:29.560
What the...? You're not wearing anyth—

12:29.560 --> 12:32.190
There's no need to be embarrassed.

12:32.190 --> 12:35.200
Just make your move.

12:42.540 --> 12:43.870
That's it...

12:55.140 --> 12:59.000
Hey... Why don't you have panties on, either?

13:01.350 --> 13:04.260
I didn't feel like it.

13:07.090 --> 13:08.590
Your... finger...

13:10.100 --> 13:13.270
Isn't this wrong?

13:13.270 --> 13:15.520
Let me have yours.

13:16.410 --> 13:17.540
What are you—

13:17.540 --> 13:19.960
This is wrong!

13:19.960 --> 13:22.810
This is wrong, wrong, wrong, wrong!

13:26.830 --> 13:28.300
Stop that.

13:28.300 --> 13:32.800
You seem even further gone than me.

13:58.120 --> 14:04.180
We could've gone in when there was more water in the tub.

14:04.180 --> 14:05.910
Next, we'll do it in here.

14:05.910 --> 14:08.480
There's no point anymore.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.930
I mean, it's already...

14:10.900 --> 14:15.110
Anyway, I'm not even carrying it around now.

14:15.110 --> 14:17.160
I don't even know where it is.

14:17.160 --> 14:19.320
That doesn't matter anymore.

14:19.320 --> 14:21.340
It's just...

14:24.840 --> 14:27.100
I'm leaving Japan tomorrow.

14:27.100 --> 14:29.550
In other words, the experiment is finished.

14:29.550 --> 14:31.570
I'll keep your secret.

14:31.570 --> 14:35.600
So let's make love tonight.

14:35.600 --> 14:36.690
As many times as we can.

14:39.390 --> 14:41.130
Let's begin.

14:53.280 --> 14:55.230
<i>This is...</i>

14:56.350 --> 14:59.430
Are you the patient's sister?

14:59.430 --> 15:00.610
<i>...a hospital?</i>

15:00.610 --> 15:02.880
We've had a look at the results,

15:02.880 --> 15:05.680
and unfortunately, there's been no improvement.

15:05.680 --> 15:10.000
This is partially due to the absence of cognitive symptoms that delayed diagnosis.

15:10.000 --> 15:12.640
And because it's so close to the spinal chord,

15:12.640 --> 15:14.790
surgical removal of the tumor will be extremely difficult.

15:14.790 --> 15:16.330
Saitou-san.

15:17.290 --> 15:18.030
Yes.

15:18.030 --> 15:20.190
I am very sorry to say this,

15:20.190 --> 15:22.890
but the probability of success is extremely low.

15:22.890 --> 15:26.000
Please be prepared for the worst.

15:26.000 --> 15:28.200
However, we will do our best.

15:28.200 --> 15:31.740
Apparently, the surgery can be done this month,

15:31.740 --> 15:35.590
and then, the doctor said that you'll definitely get better!

15:36.750 --> 15:39.620
No, I have no hope.

15:39.620 --> 15:40.920
I just know it!

15:42.620 --> 15:44.340
Don't give up!

15:44.340 --> 15:46.350
Believe in yourself!

15:46.350 --> 15:51.360
I can't really help, but I'm praying that it'll be a success.

15:51.510 --> 15:54.330
Praying won't change a thing.

15:51.810 --> 15:54.320
In Operation

15:54.330 --> 15:55.910
But...

15:55.910 --> 15:59.490
At least... before the end...

15:59.490 --> 16:01.390
I want to make love with you before I die.

16:02.870 --> 16:04.550
It's always been on my mind.

16:04.550 --> 16:08.130
You're not just a sister to me anymore.

16:08.130 --> 16:10.800
What are you... talking about?

16:10.800 --> 16:12.160
I...

16:12.160 --> 16:12.580
No!

16:16.160 --> 16:19.220
Sorry! There's something wrong with me.

16:19.220 --> 16:22.750
Forget it... I wasn't being serious.

16:22.750 --> 16:24.690
I'm going to have the operation.

16:24.690 --> 16:27.870
Even if I don't do anything...

16:27.870 --> 16:33.770
So the reason why you've never dated anyone was...

16:37.160 --> 16:38.250
Okay.

16:39.910 --> 16:43.450
You can do whatever you want.

16:44.630 --> 16:48.660
I wanna do whatever I can to help.

17:33.630 --> 17:36.270
It'd be great if you could lock up before you leave.

17:42.240 --> 17:43.270
I know.

17:45.640 --> 17:48.960
I can lock up for you.

17:58.660 --> 18:02.360
You don't need to tell me that.

18:04.740 --> 18:05.860
But...

18:08.700 --> 18:10.830
Why?

19:02.720 --> 19:05.140
Why did you just disappear?

19:06.440 --> 19:09.140
Why didn't you explain everything to me?

19:10.200 --> 19:12.620
Your brother died... Didn't he?

19:16.510 --> 19:18.390
And...

19:20.440 --> 19:26.140
And he manipulated his own little sister like that.

19:26.140 --> 19:30.100
Kiichan, did you see my memories?

19:31.030 --> 19:34.540
That was too selfish!

19:34.540 --> 19:36.300
What was that?!

19:36.300 --> 19:39.020
I'm sorry I didn't tell you...

19:39.020 --> 19:41.130
But no matter what the reason was...

19:41.130 --> 19:44.650
There's no changing the fact that I betrayed you.

19:44.650 --> 19:46.120
It's unforgivable.

19:46.120 --> 19:48.970
That's right. It <i>is</i> unforgivable.

19:49.840 --> 19:53.490
If you disappear again without telling me,

19:54.420 --> 19:56.870
I really will kill you.

19:58.070 --> 19:59.910
Without tell—

20:14.730 --> 20:17.390
I'll do it.

20:17.390 --> 20:20.030
We'll do more things together.

20:17.390 --> 20:23.270
The empress

20:20.030 --> 20:21.970
We'll fill each other with memories.

20:21.970 --> 20:23.270
And then...

20:23.270 --> 20:26.680
I'll make you mine.

20:23.270 --> 20:28.040
she stands all alone

20:26.680 --> 20:30.850
Even if I have to force you with my powers.

20:28.040 --> 20:34.560
with her forlorn

20:30.850 --> 20:34.560
Because no matter how you touch my body,

20:34.560 --> 20:39.180
I get excited because I love you so much.

20:34.560 --> 20:39.180
blue jewels

20:39.180 --> 20:41.660
Maybe I'm just a pervert.

20:39.180 --> 20:45.920
By your side,

20:44.610 --> 20:45.920
What about you?

20:45.920 --> 20:51.130
No matter what happens, I'll still like everything about you.

20:45.920 --> 20:51.470
I tremble

20:51.130 --> 20:52.570
I love you.

20:51.470 --> 20:57.240
Just hold me

20:56.220 --> 20:58.850
This is so messed up.

20:57.240 --> 21:02.740
and my vanished courage

20:58.850 --> 21:00.440
But... I'm glad.

21:01.510 --> 21:04.930
I love you, too!

21:02.740 --> 21:07.040
There are many people

21:04.930 --> 21:06.530
Aaya...

21:07.040 --> 21:13.020
searching for answers to this world

21:10.530 --> 21:14.720
I forgot to lock the door.

21:13.020 --> 21:22.760
but of you, I know nothing

21:14.720 --> 21:17.420
Well, let's go.

21:18.550 --> 21:20.210
Okay!

21:27.870 --> 21:33.470
If only I could

21:31.150 --> 21:32.310
Aaya!

21:33.200 --> 21:35.750
Wh-What should we do?!

21:33.470 --> 21:38.680
I would leave time behind

21:35.750 --> 21:36.960
The sea!

21:38.680 --> 21:44.840
and cry a yell that turns all ages to history

21:44.840 --> 21:50.480
If only I could

21:50.480 --> 21:55.390
with the same passion

21:50.720 --> 21:54.150
<i>I want to see the beautiful sea!</i>

21:55.390 --> 22:01.130
I'll transform my naked figure

22:01.130 --> 22:06.590
into your only girlfriend

22:12.060 --> 22:16.020
I think I really have lost it.

22:16.020 --> 22:18.350
It doesn't matter. It's done its job.

22:16.190 --> 22:22.070
Infectiously

22:18.350 --> 22:20.770
Where did you get that?

22:20.770 --> 22:23.190
I bought it online.

22:22.070 --> 22:26.960
When separated by a supernatural force ==>
Your wish will come true in a new world

22:22.070 --> 22:26.960
an aurora in a bottle

22:23.190 --> 22:26.130
I see... You got it online...

22:26.130 --> 22:30.290
But... I'm glad I gave it a chance,

22:26.960 --> 22:32.560
So exquisite

22:30.290 --> 22:32.560
because I was able to meet you.

22:32.560 --> 22:36.130
And incredible things have happened! Look!

22:32.560 --> 22:38.100
A floating treasure

22:36.130 --> 22:38.100
It's so beautiful.

22:38.100 --> 22:43.300
Yeah, but where are we?

22:38.100 --> 22:43.130
The universe

22:43.130 --> 22:49.040
roars a giant avalanche

22:43.300 --> 22:46.270
Maybe it's a distant planet...

22:46.270 --> 22:48.010
I don't care where we are.

22:48.010 --> 22:50.440
As long as you're with me.

22:49.040 --> 22:59.010
but I will not disappear

22:51.360 --> 22:53.890
Hey, Aaya.

22:53.890 --> 22:55.750
I've seen the future.

22:56.860 --> 23:00.310
We'll be together forever.

23:00.990 --> 23:06.730
If we could

23:06.730 --> 23:11.610
I'd like you and I

23:11.610 --> 23:17.960
to share a kiss that would annihilate all reason

23:17.960 --> 23:23.560
If I could

23:23.560 --> 23:28.610
I would give flight to this passion

23:28.610 --> 23:31.410
as though they are ripples

23:31.410 --> 23:40.630
I want to believe in these newborn feelings
